WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.784
We are going to get a haircut. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:10.104
We sit in the big chair in front of the mirror.

3
00:00:10.104 --> 00:00:17.424
The barber puts a soft cape on our shoulders. It keeps hair off our clothes.

4
00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:25.488
The barber might use clippers. Clippers make a buzzing sound. That is normal.

5
00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:32.688
Or the barber uses scissors. Snip, snip, near our ears.

6
00:00:32.688 --> 00:00:40.608
Small hairs fall down. They do not hurt. We can brush them off later.

7
00:00:40.608 --> 00:00:46.392
If it is too loud, we can say: can we take a short break.

8
00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:52.272
The cape comes off, the barber brushes our neck, and we are done.

9
00:00:52.272 --> 00:01:00.480
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

